What does the following program print?
```java
class Point {
    int x;
    Point(int x) {
        this.x = x;
    }
}

public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Point p1 = new Point(5);
        Point p2 = new Point(5);
        System.out.println((p1 == p2) + " " + (p1.x == p2.x));
    }
}
```

