What is printed when this program is executed?
```java
class Data {
    int num;
    Data(int num) {
        this.num = num;
    }
}

public class Main {
    static void modify(Data d) {
        d.num = 40;
        d = new Data(50);
    }

    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Data item = new Data(10);
        modify(item);
        System.out.println(item.num);
    }
}
```

